^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
A converting constructor SFINAE-constrained through a nested trait whose member
is a decltype expanding a two-or-more-element call-argument pack
(declval<A>()...) -- the libstdc++ __invoke_result shape -- is selected: the
pack is expanded during the trait's instantiation by template_mapt::apply.
